invariant: INV-61
file: tls.c
catches: cnsa2_test_mldsa
reason: ch_connect takes a pin of the fixed length or longer, so a 2593-byte
  ML-DSA-87 pin, which is provisioning corruption, sends a hello.
  test_mldsa_cfg requires CH_EINVAL with no send.

--- old
    return len == CH_PIN_FIXED_LEN;
--- new
    return len >= CH_PIN_FIXED_LEN;
